eal-World Success Stories",pText:"Our clients don't just get better at leadership—they drive real, lasting impact. We measure success by your results, not just how good the coaching feels in the moment and beyond."},{image:{signedId:"",placeholder:l},h5Text:"Ongoing Support and Accountability",pText:"Most leadership programs leave you on your own. We don’t. Get ongoing coaching, an engaged community, weekly mastermind calls, and real-time support exactly when you need it most."},{image:{signedId:"",placeholder:i},h5Text:"Confidential Partnership",pText:"Leadership challenges require a safe space. Everything shared in our coaching sessions and community remains 100% confidential, allowing you to be vulnerable, authentic, and open about your real challenges."}].map(function(e){return(0,d.g)(e)})},styles:{prop:"styles",type:"styles",value:function(e){for(var t=1;t<arguments.length;t++){var r=null!=arguments[t]?arguments[t]:{},n=Object.keys(r);"function"==typeof Object.getOwnPropertySymbols&&(n=n.concat(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(r).filter(function(e){return Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(r,e).enumerable}))),n.forEach(function(t){var n;n=r[t],t in e?Object.defineProperty(e,t,{value:n,enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0}):e[t]=n})}return e}({},(0,y.ED)())}}}},29019:function(e,t,r){"use strict";r.d(t,{d:()=>i});var n=r(21530),o=r(85041),a=r(96298),i={id:(0,n.Z)(),type:"HomepageBlock5",props:{content:{prop:"children",type:"children",value:[{number:"94%",text:"Client satisfaction rate"},{number:"150+",text:"Executive coaches"},{number:"12+",text:"Years of experience"},{number:"30+",text:"Industries served"}].map(function(e){return(0,o.R)(e)})},styles:{prop:"styles",type:"styles",value:function(e){for(var t=1;t<arguments.length;t++){var r=null!=arguments[t]?arguments[t]:{},n=Object.keys(r);"function"==typeof Object.getOwnPropertySymbols&&(n=n.concat(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(r).filter(function(e){return Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(r,e).enumerable}))),n.forEac